Two plus three equals five
Print the digit 5 (ASCII 53)

++           cell0 = 2
>+++         cell1 = 3
[<+>-]       move cell1 into cell0 (cell0 = 5)
<            go to cell0
>++++++[<++++++++>-]<   add 48 to cell0 (6 times 8 = 48)
.            print ASCII 53 which is the character 5
>++++++++++. print newline (cell1 = 10)
